EN:
They don't sell much here,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but at
least they're open all the time. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Wait—{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}that sounds like trouble!

TRANSLATION:
Burada pek fazla şey satmıyorlar,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama en azından hep açık. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Bir dakika—{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}bu hiç iyiye işaret değil!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}This place is great for when you
just need to buy something,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ANYTHING, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}and nothing is open.
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I don't even want to think about
how many Bells I've dropped in
here{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Der Supermarkt ist gewissermaßen
eine Einladung zum Sterniausgeben.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Da gehen sie hin, die Sternis{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
